{"message":"The strongest sign-up offer I found is the EcoCard promotion: earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking-account deposit—after spending at least $5,000 in eligible purchases during your first month. You must be a new customer, and the account must remain open and in good standing. The documented offer window is August 1 through December 15, 2025, so it may no longer be available depending on when you apply.

The EcoCard earns 5 points per dollar on green purchases and 1 point per dollar on other purchases. I did not find a current general-purpose sign-up cash-back bonus in the available offer information. For comparison, the Gold Rewards Card offers ongoing 2.5% cash back but no documented sign-up bonus; it requires a Rho-Bank+ subscription and a minimum credit score of 720.

If you can comfortably meet the $5,000 first-month spending requirement, the EcoCard is the best documented promotional offer. Otherwise, a card with strong ongoing cash back may be more valuable. I can narrow this down if you share your approximate monthly spending and whether you prefer cash back or travel/other rewards."}
